            "title": "Width",
            "id": 58839,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Görsellerin boyutunu değiştirmek için öznitelikleri kullanabiliriz. <code>width</code> ve <code>height</code> öznitelikleri varsayılan ölçü birimi olarak pikseli kullanır.</p><p>Örneğin, bu görselin genişliğini 100px olarak ayarlamak için <code>width = \"100\"</code> kodunu yaz.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"img\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"src\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.app/i/earth.png&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"width\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;100&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"height\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;200&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"40\" endIndex=\"45\" /><option startIndex=\"45\" endIndex=\"46\" /><option startIndex=\"46\" endIndex=\"51\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;100&gt;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>width</code>, ardından <code>=</code> ve son olarak <code>\"100\"</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Görsel boyutunu özniteliklerle değiştirebiliriz. <code>width</code> ve <code>height</code> varsayılan olarak piksel kullanır.</p><p>Yalnızca görselin genişliğini <code>100</code> piksel olarak ayarla.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"img\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"src\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.app/i/earth.png&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"width\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;100&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"height\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;200&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"40\" endIndex=\"45\" /><option startIndex=\"45\" endIndex=\"46\" /><option startIndex=\"46\" endIndex=\"51\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"height\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;width&gt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;200&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>width</code>, ardından <code>=</code> ve son olarak <code>\"100\"</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
